{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます  ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は盛りだくさんの記事です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握の前の夜に\nアンダーメンバーみんなで温泉"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりん、まひろときゃいきゃいしたわー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん「プールって痩せるだって‼」ざぶーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「そりゃ泳ぐしかやん‼」ざぶーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみも途中で参加させて\nきゃーいきゃいきゃーいきゃい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋でのホテルはねねとでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「どーする?私が朝目覚ましより先起きてたらどーする⁇」にやにや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね「ないやろ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねが起こしてくれてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅんちゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね、やさしーわあああぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジアムライブ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左胸の勇気を披露させていただきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サポーターの方に\n受け入れてもらえるか不安でしたが、\nみなさん本当にあたたかくて...‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ふぁむの方もっ‼\nわざわざ来てくださって\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援をありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気いっぱいに踊ったよ♪♪\n左胸の勇気、だいすきな曲‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ後、試合観戦ー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真 マネージャー風"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めてサッカーの試合を観戦したのですが...\nいやっもう‼すごい‼‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱気がすごい‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい‼\nサッカーってすごい‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフタイムになんとスタジアムを\n一周させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手を振ってくださって\nありがとうございました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りの新幹線で\n名古屋のみそかつ弁当むしゃむしゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーーーいしーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日はお仕事終わりに\nまいまい、みゅみゅ、らりん、まひろ、ひめか\nとご飯たべてきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く食べたすぎて\n店員さん「チーズクリームスパゲティのお客様ー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「はいっっっっっっっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勢いよく手をあげたらちょうど隣で\n水飲んでたみゅうみゅうのコップに\n手がヒット。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああああああぁぁぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅうごめんーーー‼‼‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分あほしたーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあほあほあほーーー‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後、みんなで語り。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなありがとうね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかがまりか♪\nて呼んでくれるようになりました:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめか、私にぴとってくっついて\n「まりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」て言って\nじーーーーーと見てくるねん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめか「まりかっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「ひめかっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめか「まりかっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「ひめ......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、今日マスク越しやったけど、\nひめかとちゅーした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめか「ちゅーしちゃうぞっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間はハードスケジュールで\n大変だったけど、うれしかった‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなおつかれさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/26/7321734/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週もハードやけど、\nめっちゃ頑張るっっっ‼\n頑張りまりかです‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}